 # Reminders
 
+For maintainers changing pickup reminders, this page records the channel and timing and the results of the previous
+email trial, when more pickups were missed.
+
 ## Channel
 
-A reminder goes by SMS to the member's phone, `CHANNEL` in `larder/reminders.py`. From April to June 2025 the pantry
-tried email to save the SMS cost: 34% of reminders were never opened, missed pickups rose from 6% to 13% of pantry
-orders, and the volunteers threw away the fresh food in the bags nobody collected. SMS came back in July.
+A reminder goes by email to the member's email address, selected by `CHANNEL` in
+[`larder/reminders.py`](../../larder/reminders.py), to remove the pantry's €40 monthly SMS cost.
+
+From April to June 2025 the pantry tried email to save the SMS cost: 34% of reminders were never opened, missed
+pickups rose from 6% to 13% of pantry orders, and the volunteers threw away the fresh food in the bags nobody
+collected. SMS came back in July 2025; email is now selected again to reduce costs.
 
